  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Grass_Overhaul/BH_GO_Header.webp\" alt=\"草地革新模組標誌\" width=\"982\" height=\"280\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"219\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><em><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/SUPPORTS-FABRIC, FORGE, QUILT-e0961d?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=CurseForge&amp;labelColor=030B14\" width=\"288\" height=\"78\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ElocinDev-贊助我-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Ko-Fi&amp;labelColor=030B14\" alt=\"\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></span></em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em><strong>草地革新</strong>&nbsp;是一款裝飾與便利性模組，新增可堆疊的類地毯草皮方塊、草皮半磚和完整草皮方塊。</em></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><em>這些草皮可用於打造更細緻的地形，同時保留原版風格。甚至與材質包完全相容。</em></em></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fELOCIN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Grass_Overhaul/BH_GO_Promo.webp\" alt=\"使用優惠碼「ELOCIN」享Bisecthosting 25%折扣\" width=\"982\" height=\"280\"></a><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Grass_Overhaul/BH_GO_Features.webp\" alt=\"功能特色\" width=\"984\" height=\"105\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🌱 <strong>草皮方塊、半磚與草皮塊 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🧱&nbsp;<strong>可堆疊草皮塊.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>🎨 無縫色彩融合</strong>.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✏️ <strong>材質包相容性.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">☀️ <strong>著色器PBR&nbsp;相容性.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚙️ <strong>原版與模組地圖相容性.</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1083823318358032394/1085383437969534997/BH_GO_Frame.png\" alt=\"遊戲內截圖\" width=\"1093\" height=\"561\"></strong></span><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1104168106160574636/1161320166580293662/recipes.webp\" alt=\"合成配方\" width=\"978\" height=\"489\"></p>\n\n（注：保留所有原始链接与图片路径，仅对说明文字进行繁体中文本地化翻译，包括功能描述、按钮文字和提示信息，同时调整部分术语如「贊助我」、「材質包」等符合繁体中文用户习惯）",
